# DeepSeek's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-deepseek-setting-api-key = A DeepSeek API key from https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys. It reads the remaining credit balance.
usage-deepseek-setting-platform-token = Used when no API key is set. Sign in to https://platform.deepseek.com, open Developer Tools > Application > Local Storage > https://platform.deepseek.com, and copy the value of the userToken entry (either the whole JSON value or just its "value" field).
